<!-- ID: phase_review_results -->
## Phase Review Results

Static evidence that passed:
- Same-server constant process with varying `root` is implemented.
- Default roots include `/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp` and `/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/council_mcp`.
- Rows carry `host_wall_ms`, structured `scribe_timing`, and normalized hook labels.
- Probe output is structured JSON/panel output rather than transcript prose.

Required commands passed:
- `uv run pytest tests/test_scribe_probe.py -q` -> 11 passed in 0.09s.
- `python -m compileall -q src/scribe_mcp/scripts/scribe_probe.py tests/test_scribe_probe.py` -> passed.
- `git diff --check -- src/scribe_mcp/scripts/scribe_probe.py tests/test_scribe_probe.py` -> passed.

Blocking live proof:
- `uv run python src/scribe_mcp/scripts/scribe_probe.py --tools same_server_root_comparison --project integrate-system-scribe-latency-20260616T050042Z --agent Crucible-P5 --hook-label hook_state_unknown --compact` failed with `column "correlation_id" does not exist`.
- Probe rows had `scribe_total_ms: null` and `attribution.classification: unknown`.
- Tests only exercise mocked `_run_tool` success and synthetic attribution rows; they do not cover the live no-phase-timing failure path.

