<!-- ID: recommendations -->
## Recommendations

- Repair the live runtime/schema issue causing set_project telemetry writes to fail with missing `correlation_id` in Postgres.
- Re-run the live same-server comparison command until it returns numeric `scribe_total_ms` values for both required roots.
- Add coverage for the failure mode where set_project returns no timing/error rows, or ensure the live probe command is part of validation.
- Keep the probe attribution-only; do not use this repair as a reason to optimize set_project or mutate config.
- Keep CHECKLIST `p2-root-comparison` not done until repaired P5 receives package-specific Crucible PASS.

